chanism linking these variables in either direction. Without a defined spatial or temporal context and absent mediators, a causal relationship cannot be established.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.368501281557668, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8281771279291988, 'min_prob': 0.0690715778567804, 'token_prob_slope': -0.007634105312848867, 'prob_variance': 0.07929251906954912, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.106450187107118, 'avg_nll': 0.3137161859670424}

