l empowered by the resources at their disposal and thus desire more independence in decision-making. The availability of equipment supposedly makes people crave greater control and self-direction in their tasks.", 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.375, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'spurious_motivation': "Having access to more equipment directly increases a person's need for autonomy because individuals feel empowered by the resources at their disposal and thus desire more independence in decision-making. The availability of equipment supposedly makes people crave greater control and self-direction in their tasks.", 'corruption_type': 'structural'}

