iers. These barriers typically arise from patient-provider language differences or cultural mismatches, not from the professional's functioning. Therefore, there is no causal relationship in either direction.", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.4749819173898568, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7895502448654331, 'min_prob': 0.05263749191059992, 'token_prob_slope': -0.004784488936095004, 'prob_variance': 0.08955595697378142, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0200038783770211, 'avg_nll': 0.38864573031992894}

