 find, understand, and use health information) and lists related objectives, but it says nothing about spatial skills, maps, or the ability to comprehend spatial scales or spatial representations of data. There is no evidence in the cited material that higher health literacy directly improves spatial information processing."}], "aggregate_score": 0.1, "aggregate_verdict": "Partially supported"}', 'motivation': "Higher health literacy directly improves individuals' ability to comprehend and navigate spatial scales, such as understanding maps or spatial representations of data. This is because people who are more knowledgeable about health are also more adept at processing spatial information.", 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.1, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'spurious_motivation': "Higher health literacy directly improves individuals' ability to comprehend and navigate spatial scales, such as understanding maps or spatial representations of data. This is because people who are more knowledgeable about health are also more adept at processing spatial information.", 'corruption_type': 'structural'}

