ence that there is no causal relationship between incorrect medication use and feelings of fear and shame, nor do they support the explicit claim that no such link can be established."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': "There is no direct causal relationship from 'Incorrect use of medication' to 'Feelings of fear and shame' or vice versa based on the variable definitions and provided context. Without defined mechanisms or clear pathways, no causal link can be established. If either variable's definition or mechanism is unspecified, causality cannot be assumed.", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.864802976279796, 'mean_token_prob': 0.712007347919116, 'min_prob': 0.019958261899686507, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0057445210661383915, 'prob_variance': 0.12788704163659664, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.3703648326090685, 'avg_nll': 0.6231554047697733}

