ays involving language proficiency and diagnostic/resource outcomes."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': 'Language and cultural barriers do not directly cause diagnostic resources, nor do diagnostic resources cause language and cultural barriers. There is no established causal mechanism linking changes in one to direct changes in the other. Any association would be mediated by other variables, such as accessibility or functioning of healthcare professionals.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.4942491226979375, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7862217102722657, 'min_prob': 0.07552685629241823, 'token_prob_slope': -0.005519620886856269, 'prob_variance': 0.09909237653272006, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.8953273183341434, 'avg_nll': 0.40162382160339094}

