nship can be established between these variables.", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.5107716121700185, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7844239109679669, 'min_prob': 0.0323493868591836, 'token_prob_slope': -0.005768512270417517, 'prob_variance': 0.09079026207281432, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.304178761815304, 'avg_nll': 0.4126205217471579}

