ation': 'Chronic addiction does not cause Availability of alternatives for ED, nor does Availability of alternatives for ED cause Chronic addiction. There is no direct causal mechanism linking these two variables. Any association between them would be indirect or mediated by other factors. Therefore, no direct causal relationship exists.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.19032646368001, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8789989861265296, 'min_prob': 0.18215882102871137, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0047531885990734195, 'prob_variance': 0.04198642807389006, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.797923918236203, 'avg_nll': 0.17422760872621246}

