tors, but it does not mention \\"frailty\\" nor provide evidence that chronic addiction has no association with frailty. Absence of discussion of frailty in the citation does not support a claim of no relationship."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': "I don't know", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.0681999478729365, 'mean_token_prob': 0.9512869165188427, 'min_prob': 0.5040186936398259, 'token_prob_slope': -0.008450733194514738, 'prob_variance': 0.020118055731758025, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.2642311667839307, 'avg_nll': 0.06597494012455808}

