 as knowledge itself biologically enhances muscle performance.", 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'spurious_motivation': "Increasing a person's knowledge directly causes an increase in their physical capacity. The more facts and information someone learns, the stronger and more enduring their muscles become, as knowledge itself biologically enhances muscle performance.", 'corruption_type': 'structural'}

