ore, no causal relationship exists between them.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.1435277355398883, 'mean_token_prob': 0.9095016794704202, 'min_prob': 0.16999285328871583, 'token_prob_slope': -0.003109837519771454, 'prob_variance': 0.03510827097005365, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.668665025320822, 'avg_nll': 0.1341179891405428}

