 the idea that relationships are commonly mediated rather than purely direct, but it does not directly substantiate the claim that no direct causal mechanism exists between multi-morbidity and chronic addiction."}], "aggregate_score": 0.25, "aggregate_verdict": "Partially supported"}', 'motivation': 'Multi-morbidity does not directly cause chronic addiction, nor does chronic addiction directly cause multi-morbidity within the system as defined. No direct causal mechanism exists between these two variables without mediation by other factors present in the CLD.', 'aggregate_score': 0.25, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'perplexity': 1.3347812256616534, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8470421424323821, 'min_prob': 0.027124402343646725, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0051008930632252154, 'prob_variance': 0.07241857988247243, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0329683887694978, 'avg_nll': 0.28876740251421507}

