als who avoid healthcare are less likely to be diagnosed with additional conditions. As a result, their medical records reflect fewer comorbidities, suggesting that care avoidance reduces measured multi-morbidity.', 'original_polarity': 'POSITIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here'}

